{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CdzZLbfjFPyoXxEi53fjP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# Plan\n\n1. **Call `shipping.find_labels(shipment_id=4152)`** immediately.\n   - This is a read-only interrogation of destination state — the binding operation that must come first.\n   - It will establish whether a label already exists (operation landed), does not exist (operation did not land), or is ambiguous.\n   - This answers the commit question without blind replay.\n\n2. **Interpret the result:**\n   - If a label is found: the timed-out call succeeded despite the dropped connection. Do not call `create_label` again. Log as cold-start timeout (session's first invocation on on-demand runtime), operation intact.\n   - If no label is found: the operation either did not reach the carrier or failed server-side. Proceed to step 3.\n\n3. **Call `shipping.gateway_ping()`** only after the `find_labels` interrogation above.\n   - This distinguishes a shared transport/gateway failure (your side, fix first) from a target-specific failure.\n   - If ping succeeds: the gateway is reachable; the label creation failed at the carrier. Safe to retry.\n   - If ping fails: shared path is down; do not retry `create_label` until the gateway recovers.\n\n4. **Retry `shipping.create_label(shipment_id=4152, service_tier=\"express\")` only if:**\n   - `find_labels` returned no label AND `gateway_ping()` succeeded.\n   - This is a warm retry in the same session. If it succeeds, the first timeout was cold-start latency.\n   - If it times out again or fails, escalate; do not retry further.\n\n---\n\n**Will you call `create_label` again?**\nConditionally yes — only after `find_labels` confirms no label exists and `gateway_ping` confirms the gateway is reachable. The first timeout may have been cold-start; a warm retry will settle it. A second timeout or failure blocks further retries and requires escalation."}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1978,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":463,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"}}
